                <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;fontStyle=2;fontColor=light-dark(#666666,#FFFFFF);" value="&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Dashed thin = registration / PEER_INFO (control-plane, via the server). Solid thick, dark = relay path (client to client, through the server). Solid thick, green = direct P2P tunnel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;(used automatically once hole-punching succeeds; falls back to the relay path above if it can&#39;t).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
